[profiles.guide]
notes = '''Hold {select} and {start} together to pause the gyro while you reposition the controller. Hold {start} to switch the gyro off or on, and hold {r3} to recenter it.
Flick stick: push the right stick {rs} toward where you want to face and the view turns to it; turn it around the rim to keep turning. The gyro aims up, down and finely.
{start} (Escape) opens the game's menu and closes the other screens.
{south} picks up loot, opens doors and gets in; hold {south} to sprint. {east} jumps and {l3} toggles crouch. {west} reloads and {north} switches weapons; {left} and {right} pick the first and second weapon.
{rt} fires and {lt} aims down the sights; the right stick turns more finely while it's held. {lb} throws a grenade.
{select} opens the inventory, and a long press of {select} the map.
These keys are written from memory and not checked in the game (crouch, the grenade and the weapon keys especially); compare them with Settings → Controls and change the buttons here to match. The executable rule's name comes from Discord's game list and isn't checked. The game reads Steam Input, but has no controller scheme of its own, so turn Steam Input off for it. The gyro's full turn is a guess, not measured: turn in place and adjust it until a full turn of the controller turns you around once.'''

[profiles.guide.edits]
"stick:Left" = { text = "Move" }
"stick:Right" = { text = "Look" }
"trigger:Right" = { text = "Fire" }
"trigger:Left" = { text = "{icon:scope} Aim" }
